program.dfy(65,0): Error: a postcondition could not be proved on this return path

program.dfy(63,12): Related location: this is the postcondition that could not be proved
   |
63 |     ensures exists i, j :: 0 <= i < (|lst|) - 1 && IsEven(lst[i]) && IsFirstEven(i, lst) &&
   |             ^^^^^^

Dafny program verifier finished with 7 verified, 1 error

